<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 817 0 R
/E (Equal: The Equal Game encourages reflection on gender stereotypes and equality. Through playful scenarios, learners identify biases and explore the idea that opportunities should be available to everyone regardless of gender. It strengthens awareness of inclusivity and respect.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 818 0 R
/E (Cookies for Peace: In this role-play cooking activity, groups of students must bake cookies. However, resources are unevenly distributed: some groups have too much, others too little. The aim is for groups to negotiate and share in order to succeed. The game highlights inequalities in resource distribution and stresses the importance of solidarity and cooperation.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
