<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (The rehearsal phase is the moment when pupils showcase their interactive stories or games and see how their work connects to the collective storyline. Each group presents its creation to the rest of the class, who play, listen, or watch and then try to identify which SDG is represented. This peer exchange allows pupils to test whether their civic message is clear and whether their interactive program communicates the intended idea. The rehearsal is also an opportunity for the whole class to appreciate the diversity of approaches: some groups may have built a game, others an interactive story, a musical sequence, or a short animated scene, but all contributions are equally part of the collective adventure.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7 8 9]
>>
endobj
