<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (This showcase does not have to remain within the class. Projects can also be presented to another class in the school, or to parents during a collective projection event. In this way, pupils take pride in sharing their work with a larger audience, and their digital creations become a tool for spreading awareness of the SDGs within the whole school community.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
endobj
