/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 138 0 R
/E (As a teacher, encourage pupils to regularly test their programmes, within their team but also with their classmates to check the clarity of their message and the interactivity. They can adjust elements step by step, learning that programming is mainly about trial, error, and improvement.)
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
776 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 138 0 R
/E (By the end of this activity, each group will have produced a playable prototype or an interactive story that illustrates their chosen SDG. The quality of the programme may vary, but the focus is on the clarity of the civic message and the creative use of MakeCode Arcade features. Pupils will also have experienced teamwork, decision-making, and the process of iterating on a project.)
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
